        <mxCell id="title-inf" parent="wzaWelZTSMigGxsfthm2-23" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#F8FAFC;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Pulse Play&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="73.125" width="434" x="93" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle-inf" parent="wzaWelZTSMigGxsfthm2-23" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#A7B4C8;fontSize=15;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0)); font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;ML Inference Pipeline Architecture&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="48.75" width="620" y="81.25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iA6NnwwOyyoF_UFz8jpi-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#111827;gradientColor=#1E293B;gradientDirection=south;strokeColor=#64748B;fontColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=12;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;API Route Contract&lt;br&gt;GET / - landing, redirects authenticated users to dashboard&lt;br&gt;GET /dashboard - protected recommendation UI&lt;br&gt;GET/POST /auth/signup - render form and create user&lt;br&gt;GET/POST /auth/login - render form, validate credentials, set JWT cookies&lt;br&gt;GET /auth/refresh - rotate refresh token and issue new access token&lt;br&gt;POST /auth/logout - revoke refresh token and clear cookies&lt;br&gt;GET /api/song/search - check song availability and unlock valid filters&lt;br&gt;POST /api/recommend/content - content similarity recommendations&lt;br&gt;POST /api/recommend/collaborative - user-history collaborative recommendations&lt;br&gt;POST /api/recommend/hybrid - blended recommendations with diversity control&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="205" width="575" x="100" y="1040" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4mdnSR3_ze1vafzmh49-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#111827;gradientColor=#1E293B;gradientDirection=south;strokeColor=#64748B;fontColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=13;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Deployment Cycle&lt;br&gt;CI/CD builds/tests and pushes the inference image to ECR. Production rollout is currently manual on EC2/ASG behind the ALB. AWS CodeDeploy would automate rolling or blue/green deploys, but it is not available in this setup, so deployment steps remain manual. See CI/CD pipeline for build details.&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="445" x="710" y="1050" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I4mdnSR3_ze1vafzmh49-4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=4;strokeColor=light-dark(#94A3B8,#334155);gradientColor=light-dark(#F8FAFC,#1E293B);fillColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#111827);strokeWidth=1.2;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=light-dark(#334155,#E5E7EB);fontSize=12;perimeterSpacing=1;" value="" vertex="1">
